    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83c\udf89 The Last Exam is going to Gamescom 2025!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re proud to be part of the Indie Arena Booth this year \u2014 and even more excited to share our brand-new demo with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try it now on Steam and come visit us in Cologne this August!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live Dylan\u2019s Last Exam</strong> \u2014 a heartfelt, hand-drawn watercolor adventure where every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Explore &amp; Uncover:</strong><br>Wander through a beautifully crafted city on Dylan\u2019s final exam day. Meet quirky locals, revisit his past, and discover hidden memories around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Puzzle Your Way Forward:</strong><br>Solve environmental and logic puzzles using observation and intuition. Every challenge draws you deeper into Dylan\u2019s world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcad Personal Storytelling:</strong><br>Unravel Dylan\u2019s relationships, anxieties, and hopes through tender interactions and emotional flashbacks. A bittersweet journey of memory, healing, and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Why You\u2019ll Love It:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning watercolor visuals</strong> that feel like moving paintings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy, reflective pacing</strong> \u2014 ideal for a quiet afternoon of immersive gaming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A touching, slice\u2011of\u2011life narrative</strong> with universal themes of growth and closure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted city filled with character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in puzzles that blend logic with emotional storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal Dylan\u2019s backstory through voice\u2011rich dialogue and warm scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an atmospheric, single\u2011player narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supporting Windows &amp; macOS (64\u2011bit)</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live Dylan\u2019s Last Exam</strong> \u2014 a heartfelt, hand-drawn watercolor adventure where every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Explore &amp; Uncover:</strong><br>Wander through a beautifully crafted city on Dylan\u2019s final exam day. Meet quirky locals, revisit his past, and discover hidden memories around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Puzzle Your Way Forward:</strong><br>Solve environmental and logic puzzles using observation and intuition. Every challenge draws you deeper into Dylan\u2019s world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcad Personal Storytelling:</strong><br>Unravel Dylan\u2019s relationships, anxieties, and hopes through tender interactions and emotional flashbacks. A bittersweet journey of memory, healing, and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Why You\u2019ll Love It:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning watercolor visuals</strong> that feel like moving paintings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy, reflective pacing</strong> \u2014 ideal for a quiet afternoon of immersive gaming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A touching, slice\u2011of\u2011life narrative</strong> with universal themes of growth and closure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted city filled with character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in puzzles that blend logic with emotional storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal Dylan\u2019s backstory through voice\u2011rich dialogue and warm scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an atmospheric, single\u2011player narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supporting Windows &amp; macOS (64\u2011bit)</p></li></ul>",
